%% Convención: CODE = símbolo resoluble del repositorio; EXT = actor/dependencia externa; CONCEPT = tabla, estado o regla conceptual.
%% Fuentes: Infrastructure/Login/SegundoFactor/Smtp/SecondFactorSmtpTransport.vb | Infrastructure/Login/SegundoFactor/Smtp/FrameworkSmtpClientAdapter.vb | Modelo/Login/SegundoFactor/SegundoFactorInterfaces.vb
%% Referencias CODE: CODE:SecondFactorSmtpTransport.Send | CODE:ISecondFactorSmtpClientFactory.Create | CODE:ISecondFactorSmtpClient.Send | CODE:FrameworkSmtpClientFactory.Create | CODE:FrameworkSmtpClientAdapter.Send | CODE:FrameworkSmtpClientAdapter.Dispose
sequenceDiagram
actor Sender as CODE: SecondFactorSmtpEmailSender
participant Transport as CODE: SecondFactorSmtpTransport
participant Factory as CODE: ISecondFactorSmtpClientFactory
participant Client as CODE: ISecondFactorSmtpClient
participant Server as EXT: servidor SMTP
Sender->>Transport: Send(configuration: SecondFactorSmtpConfiguration, message: SecondFactorEmailMessage): SecondFactorSmtpDelivery
alt configuración o mensaje nulo, remitente o destinatario inválido
  Transport-->>Sender: Failed, OTP_DELIVERY_FAILED
else mensaje construible
  Note over Transport: MailMessage con asunto fijo, OTP, expiración y advertencias
  Transport->>Factory: Create(configuration: SecondFactorSmtpConfiguration): ISecondFactorSmtpClient
  Factory-->>Transport: cliente configurado
  Transport->>Client: Send(message: MailMessage): Void
  Client->>Server: envío síncrono
  alt aceptado por cliente
    Transport->>Client: Dispose(): Void
    Transport-->>Sender: Submitted, OTP_SUBMITTED
  else excepción
    Transport->>Client: Dispose(): Void
    Transport-->>Sender: Failed, OTP_DELIVERY_FAILED
  end
end
